10 REM HELLO FROM THE APPLE II PLUS
20 REM THE TEXT SCREEN HAS NO COLOUR: THE TOP TWO BITS OF A SCREEN BYTE PICK
30 REM A VIDEO MODE RATHER THAN A COLOUR, SO THE CASCADE CYCLES ALL THREE
40 TEXT
50 HOME
60 FOR I = 1 TO 20
70 V = I - 3 * INT (I / 3)
80 NORMAL
90 IF V = 1 THEN FLASH
100 IF V = 2 THEN INVERSE
110 VTAB I
120 HTAB 1 + I - 12 * INT (I / 12)
130 PRINT "HELLO FROM THE APPLE II PLUS"
140 NEXT I
150 REM FLASH SETS INVFLG AND THE BIT COUT ORS IN FIRST, WHICH IS WHAT LETS
160 REM A SPACE OR A STAR FLASH AND NOT ONLY A LETTER
170 VTAB 23
180 HTAB 14
190 FLASH
200 REM THE TRAILING ; HOLDS BACK THE CARRIAGE RETURN THAT WOULD SCROLL THE
210 REM SCREEN AND TAKE THE TOP OF THE CASCADE WITH IT
220 PRINT "* BASICALLY *";
230 NORMAL
240 END
